 ## Fasteners and heat-set inserts (all projects, Brian 2026-10-31)
-- Never use self-tapping screws into printed parts; every screw joint in a print gets a heat-set insert.
+- Never use self-tapping screws into printed parts, and never plan on drilling one: every screw joint in a print gets a heat-set insert, with its bore modeled in before printing.
