+- **Shop talk (Brian, 2026-11-02):** show and ask as if standing in the shop holding the part: "pretend like it's in your hand and you have to show it to me." Show the real part from its mesh, not boxes and lines; no labels like "measurement A". The picture is the ask; keep the words to a line. Ask only for measurements he can make with a ruler or calipers.
